      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_4",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            x: 14,
            y: 7,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:apply_object",
            object: "%7B%22id%22%3A%22holywater1%22%2C%22effects%22%3A%5B%7B%22applyTo%22%3A%22attack%22%2C%22range%22%3A%22melee%22%7D%5D%2C%22abilities%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "holywater1",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_3",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cylanna",
            text: _("Krellis...choose your words carefully. Tyegëa is a bit unpredictable."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tyegea",
            text: _("Welcome, merfolk! It has been a long time since outsiders have visited. And Cylanna! It is pleasant to see you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cylanna",
            text: _("The honor is ours. I present Kai Krellis of Jotha."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tyegea",
            text: _("Indeed! So this is the one. Does he know?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("Know what?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cylanna",
            text: _("Now is not the time. We have a desperate errand, Tyegëa. Jotha has been attacked and taken."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("We were forced to flee for our lives from legions of undead. If you help us, we can remove these spirits from our home."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tyegea",
            text: _("And what makes you think I want to leave my comfortable home and risk death by attacking armies of undead?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("I had hoped..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tyegea",
            text: _("I am sure it was Cylanna’s idea that you come here. She has a reason. Don’t you Cylanna? Tell him what it is."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cylanna",
            text: _("(Sigh.) I had hoped to avoid this, but it seems I cannot."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tyegea",
            text: _("I never agreed that secrecy was necessary, but I respected Maudin’s wishes in the matter. Now Indress and Maudin are dead, and I am not. Tell the boy the truth."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("You knew my grandparents?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cylanna",
            text: _("Actually, Tyegëa is your grandmother."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("What? How is that possible?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cylanna",
            text: _("When your grandfather married Indress, he did not know that Tyegëa had already born him a son. When she delivered your father to Jotha, your grandmother Indress agreed to keep it secret and raise the infant as her own."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tyegea",
            text: _("That was quite a scandal, too, but I was not cut out to be a mother."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("I am astonished. I suppose I should be honored to have such a distinguished ancestor. Now I understand why Cylanna knew you would help us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tyegea",
            text: _("That remains to be seen. I find it disturbing that a kai — and my descendant — would run here begging for help. Before I agree to save you, you have to prove that my blood flows in your veins. Prove that your are, despite appearances, courageous, and worthy of my help."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("Well, I defeated the drakes on your island."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tyegea",
            text: _("Drakes only look dangerous. Soldiers carrying spears make short work of them. No, I have something else in mind. You will complete a task for the good of the merfolk. Listen."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tyegea",
            text: _("About 200 years ago, a powerful mermaid named Imirna fell in love with a human wizard named Agnovon. Agnovon cared not for love, but he smiled falsely at Imirna, and she trusted him. When he asked her to help him enchant a sword so that it was wreathed continuously in magic flame, she devoted all her skill to fashioning the weapon. Later, Agnovon used that very sword to defeat Imirna’s own people and steal their wealth. In her grief, Imirna poisoned herself."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tyegea",
            text: _("I have long desired to see the sword returned to the merfolk to whom it should belong. If you retrieve it, you would prove yourself to be worthy of whatever help I were to provide. I do not know precisely where to find the sword, but I know one who does. South of the Swamp of Desolation, near a ruined castle, lives a mage named Caladon. He has lusted after the sword for years, so he will know where to find the lich who keeps it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("A lich has it? We were fleeing liches in the first place."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tyegea",
            text: _("There is only one of them. If you cannot defeat even one lich, you must be expecting me to get rid of all of your undead myself!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("My apologies. You are right, of course. We will undertake this task."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tyegea",
            text: _("I will not send you away completely empty-handed, though. I can spare some holy water for one of your soldiers."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: 15,
            y: 8,
            item_name: "",
            image: "items%2Fholy-water.png",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("The holy water will make melee attacks do <i>arcane</i> damage for the rest of the campaign. Choose a unit to take it. You may recruit or recall a unit if you want."),
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
]
